Booter2.0.0.sea			Latest version of the Booter. Supports
				ELF, IDE. From Nigel Pearson

BSD_Mac68k_Booter.bin,		Latest version of the Booter and docs,
BooterManual.stxt.bin		in MacBinary form. Most Mac OS ftp clients
				can convert these directly into Mac OS
				applications on download.

BSD_Mac68k_Booter.bin.uue,	Same as above, in uu-encoded form.
BooterManual.stxt.bin.uue

Mkfs_1.45.sea.hqx		New version of the `mkfs' utility that
				should properly support "large" disks,
				correctly handle partition map updates,
				and convert arbitrary partitions to the
				types NetBSD understands.
				From Bob Nestor

Installer_1.1f.sea.hqx		New version of the Installer, with some
				added features and several bug fixes.
				From Steve Brown
